<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc2">WAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flp.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo kandika lupwilili luno ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Filipi mkipigiti cha milao ya 61 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto. Kalwandika viyakalile mkifungo (1:13), na kuno vodahika kakala mdiwambo da Loma. Todaha kukifundiza mbuli kidogo muna idiwambo da Filipi kulawa mkitabu cha Sang'hano. Filipi dikala dijo wambo kulu muisi ya Makedonia. Na hano baho wasongile wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa ichanduso muisi ya Makedonia. Paulo na Sila wao wasongile dale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ako Makedonia hamoja na hata kugeligwa mkifungo ikilo kipigiti viwakalile haja (Sang'h. 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Vodahika Paulo kakala na vilamso bwando mkwandika lupwilili luno. Katumia lupwilili hilo kamba nafasi ya kuwaheweza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto sama ya nhunza iwamgalile viwahulike kamba kakala kekigwa mkifungo (4:10-19). Vivija kawalongela hali yake muja mkifungo, na kawatambuza Timoteo na Epaflodito mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (2:19-30) giladi wawabokele na kuwahishimila ulongozi wao.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga kwandika lupwilili lwake mkuwalamsa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Filipi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kowalongela hali yake na gaja gayalinago mmoyo wake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:3-2:30">1:3—2:30</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kawalongela mbuli bwando za kuwatenda wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakale ukazi wa kuzitenda mbuli za Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paulo komambukizila mkuwaheweza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali Filipi sama ya nhunza zao na kowalamsa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4:10-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo na Timoteo, watumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Nowandikila wanhu wose wa Mulungu wang'alile wali mkiwambo cha Filipi, hamoja na vilangizi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na mashemasi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mashemasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wosang'hanika mdidale da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Paulo ha Wasomaji Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Nomuheweza Mulungu wangu sama yenu kipigiti chose nowagelegeza mweye. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Mzinhambiko zangu zose nowatambikila mweye mose mkudeng'ha, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>kwavija mkala hamoja na nie mkuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto songela mwanza wa ichanduso vumuuhulike Usenga uno mbaka kipigiti kino.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Novimanya kamba Mulungu, ayo yasongeze sang'hano ino inogile mgati yenu, koigendeleza mbaka yaimambukize mdizua dondayabwele Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Vinoga kumwangu nie kuwagelegeza mweye mose kamba vinitenda, kwavija mweye mwa mmoyo wangu. Mweye mose msang'hanika hamoja na nie muisang'hano inogile yaangwelele Mulungu, sang'hano ya kuugombeleza Usenga Unogile na kuugangamiza, kipigiti kino vunili mkifungo na kipigiti vinikalile niilegehe. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Mulungu iyo msindila wangu vija viniwanogela na vija viniwasulukila mweye mose na noge dilawa ha Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Na ino iyo nhambiko yangu, kamba noge jenu jongezeke ng'hani, na mgendelele kukula muilimu na muutango, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>avo mdahe kusagula gaja ganogile, giladi kuna dizua dondayabwele Kilisto sambimuwe na mbuli ihile na mng'ale. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Mmemezwe mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye azo ziza kubitila Yesu Kilisto sama ya yenzi na nhogolwa za Mulungu.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kodeng'ha Avija Kilisto Viyopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda mweye m'vimanye kamba gano ganilawilile nie ganhaza nie kweneza Usenga Unogile, <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>kwavija wanhu wose hano hamoja na wemilizi wa iding'anda da kindewa wovitanga kamba nigeligwa mkifungo kwavija nie na msang'hana wa Kilisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Na sama ya nie kugeligwa mkifungo, wanhu bwando wamtogole Kilisto hano wagangamazwa ng'hani, na woupeta Usenga Unogile bila kudumba.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Wanhu wayagwe woupeta Usenga Unogile kwavija wonyonela migongo na uhasanyi na nie, ila wayagwe woupeta Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto na nia inogile. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Wanhu wano wompeta Kilisto sama ya noge, kwavija wavitanga kamba nisaguligwa giladi niugombele Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Ila waja wa ichanduso wompeta Kilisto sama ya kulonda watogolwe na wanhu, mmoyo wao hawagesa ganogile ila wolonda kuutenda mgayo wangu ubanze kipigiti vinili muno mkifungo.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Haduhu mbuli! Kilisto yahapetigwa mnzila zozose zija, nie nodeng'ha, kamba mngelegeza zihile ama mngelegeza zinogile. Nogendelela kudeng'ha, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>kwavija novitanga kamba kubitila nhambiko zenu na Loho wa Yesu Kilisto yahanitaza, nokomboligwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Kwavija nosulukila ng'hani na kutamanila kamba sigeligwa kinyala, ila nogendelela kulonga bila kudumba sama ya Kilisto, kamba vinitendile kipigiti kibitile. Na notamanila kamba ugima wangu womgalila hishima Kilisto, kamba nihawa mgima ama nihadanganhika. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Kwavija kumwangu nie Kilisto iyo ugima wangu, na ifa iyo nyongeza yangu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Ila ihawa nogendelela kuwa mgima, notenda mbuli zinogile ng'hani, na sikitanga kinhu kilihi chondanisagule. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Nie nogazigwa na vinhu vibili, nosulukila kudanganhika nichole kukala hamoja na Kilisto, kwavija mbuli ino inoga ng'hani kumwangu. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Ila vinoga ng'hani nie kusigala kuwa mgima sama yenu mweye. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Mbuli ino iyo inntamanila, novitanga kamba nogendelela kusigala muisi na kugendelela kukala na mweye mose, giladi mpate kudeng'ha na kukula mnhamanila, <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>avo vija vondaniwe hamoja na mweye kabili, mopata kilamso cha kuitopela mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu sama ya gaja goyotenda kubitila nie. <verse eid="PHP 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Avo kinhu kilondigwa icho kino, mkale kamba vuulonda Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto, avo kamba niheza na kuiting'hana namwe kabili ama nihahulika mbuli zenu, novimanya kamba monanahila na nia imwe moiyoha hamoja sama ya nhamanila ya Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Sambimuwadumbe wadumuka zenu. Kino kicho kilaguso kamba hewo wokwiza kubanangwa, na mweye mokwiza kukomboligwa. Na Mulungu kowatenda mweye muhume. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Kwavija Mulungu kawagwelela nafasi ya kumsang'hanikila Kilisto na sio kumtogola kwiyeka, ila vivija kugaya sama yake. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Avo mwingila muna ing'hondo hamoja na nie, ng'hondo iija inikalile nigomba nie kipigiti kibitile, na kamba vumuhulika ning'hali nigomba.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Wende na Ukulu wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Ugima wenu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto uwatenda mweye muwe na mhiko, na noge jake dowabweza moyo mweye. Muilumbe na Loho wa Mulungu, na muwe wanhu wanogile na muiyonele bazi wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Avo itendeni ndeng'helelo yangu ivikizwe mkuwa na ngelegeza imwe, noge dimwe, moyo umwe, na nia imwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Sambimtende mbuli yoyose mkuinogeza mioyo yenu iiyeka ama mkuitopa bule, ila muihunganikile mkuwagelegeza waenu wanoga kubanza mweye wenyego. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Kila munhu mmwanza wenu sambiyalole gaja gamnogele heyo, ila vivija yalole gaja gowonogela na wayage. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Ngelegeza zenu zolondigwa zilinge kamba ngelegeza zayakalile nazo Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Kilisto, ayo yakalile yalingile kamba Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ila hagesile vija viyalingile kamba Mulungu kamba kinhu cha kukigesa ng'hani.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Ila heyo mwenyego kagaleka gose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">na kugaluka kamba nyakadala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">kavumbuka kamba wanhu wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">na koneka kamba munhu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Heyo mwenyego kaihumulusa hasi, na kakala mwende ha Mulungu mbaka kudanganhika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">hata kudanganhika mumsalaba.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Avo, Mulungu kamwinula uchana ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">na kumgwelela twaga kulu kubita matwaga gose.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Avo mtwaga da Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">kila vindi difugame, kuulanga na muisi na hasi ya isi,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>na kila lulimi lutogole kamba Yesu Kilisto iyo Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">mkumuyenzi Mulungu Tata wetu.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunang'hazika Kamba Mulangaza Muulumwengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Avo, mbwiga zangu, mkala munitegeleza mazua gose vinikalile baho, vinoga ng'hani kunitegeleza kipigiti kino vinili haduhu. Mambukizeni ukombola wenu mkusang'hanika mkudumba na mkugudema, <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>kwavija Mulungu mazua gose kosang'hanika mgati yenu, mkuwagwelela mweye sulukila na mhiko ya kutenda gaja gomnogela heyo.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Tendeni mbuli zose bila kutwanganika ama kuibamilila, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>giladi sambimuwe na mbuli na munhu na kung'ala kamba wana wa Mulungu walibule uzenzeleganye, wonang'hazika kamba nhondo za kuulanga muulumwengu umemile wanhu wehile na wene vilozo. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Ugogeni ng'hani Usenga uli na ugima, avo mdizua dondayabwele Kilisto, noitopa kamba sikimbile mkimbilo wa bule na sang'hano yangu haikalile jaga bule.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Ila hata kamba nowagiza ugima wangu mkugidwa kamba ung'waji ulavigwa nhosa ha Mulungu, nonogelwa, kamba nhosa zimulava ha Mulungu mnhamanila. Na nolonda mweye mose mdeng'he hamoja na nie. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Na mweye vivija mnogelwe na kudeng'ha hamoja na nie.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoteo na Epaflodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Kamba Mndewa Yesu yahanogelwa, nomtuma Timoteo kumwenu hima, giladi yahabwela yanisindimule umoyo na mbuli zenu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Nabule munhu iyagwe kamba heyo yali na ngelegeza kamba zinilinazo nie yondayawagwelele gaja gomulonda mweye. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Kwavija wayagwe wasigale wozahila gaja gawanogele wenyego na sio gaja gamnogele Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Mweye wenyego movitanga vija Timoteo viyailaguse mwenyego kalumba, avija viyasang'hanike na nie kamba mwana na tataake mkuupeta Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Avo nogesa kumtuma kumwenu haja tu hondanigatange gaja gondaganilawilile nie hano. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Na nie nomtamanila Mndewa kamba mkipigiti kiguhi nie mwenyego nokwiza kumwenu.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Ila nogelegeza kamba vinoga kum'bweza kumwenu ndugu yangu Epaflodito, msang'hana miyangu na asikali miyangu, ayo vivija yali mtumigwa wenu, ayo imumtumile kumwangu yeze kunzahilila vinhu vinilonda. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Kwavija kasulukila ng'hani kuwona mweye mose. Na kakala na giogio kwavija muhulika kamba heyo kakala mtamu. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Kweli kakala yolumwa, behi na kudanganhika. Ila Mulungu kamonela bazi, na sio kamba kamonela bazi heyo yeiyeka ila na nie, sambimhate usungu uchana ya usungu. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Nie nolonda ng'hani kumtuma heyo kumwenu, nokona muhamona kabili modeng'helela, na nie kudungwadungwa kumwangu komala. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>M'bokeleni na noge da wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na ndeng'ha ng'hulu, na muwahishimile wanhu wali kamba heyo. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Kwavija kakala mmabehi kudanganhika sama ya sang'hano ya Kilisto, na kalonda kuwagiza ugima wake giladi yanhaze mbuli zija mweye wenyego zimulemelwe kunhendela kwavija mkala kutali.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuwa Bule Uzenzeleganye wa Ikweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Hakimambukizo, ndugu zangu, deng'heni mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa. Sidonha kuwandikila mweye kinhu kikija mwanza wa ikabili, notenda vino kuikikiwiza nhamanila yenu. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Iteganyeni na umbwa, wanhu waja wotenda mbuli zihile, awo wogong'ondeza mbuli za kukanha lukuli bila kilamso chochose. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Kwavija tweye iwo twingila kumbi da ikweli, tweye tutambika kubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu, tweye tudeng'ha mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto, tulekile kwika nhamanila yetu mulukuli, <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>hata kamba nie mwenyego nna kilamso cha kulutamanila lukuli. Kamba munhu yoyose yogelegeza kamba kana kilamso cha kulutamanila lukuli, nie nibanza. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Nie ningila kumbi kipigiti vinikalile na mazua manane songela vinivumbuke, nie na munhu wa Islaeli wa kuvumbuka, kulawa mtala wa Benjamini, Mueblania nivumbuke Mueblania. Muna imbuli ya kugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, nikala Mfalisayo. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Niiyoha ng'hani kuwagaza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. Kamba munhu kowa bule uzenzeleganye mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, nie sihonyele chochose. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Ila mbuli zija zose zinizipetile kamba zinoga, sambi nozipeta kamba jaga bule sama ya gaja gayatendile Kilisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Si gano geiyeka, ila nokona vinhu vose kamba jaga bule, uhavilinga na ukulu wa nhunza ya kumtanga Kilisto Yesu Mndewa wangu. Sama yake nivasa vinhu vose na kuvona kamba uvuludu, giladi nimpate Kilisto, <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>na kuilumba hamoja na heyo kabisa. Na silonda kuitenda mwenyego kutogoligwa na Mulungu kubitila kugatogola Malagizo ga Musa, na sambi niwa munhu nilibule uzenzeleganye kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kulawa ha mulungu kwiza kubitila nhamanila. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Nolonda kumtanga Kilisto na kuilanza mhiko ng'hulu imzusile heyo kulawa mkudanganhika. Nolonda kugaya na heyo na kudanganhika kamba viyadanganhike heyo, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>giladi mnzila imwe ama iyagwe nize kulanza mzuso wa kulawa mkudanganhika.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukimbilila Kutulonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Nie silonga kamba nisha kubokela gaja gose ganilonda ama nivika kuja kunilondigwa kuvika, ila noiyoha giladi mhate kuhuma na kubokela nhunza yangu, kamba vija Kilisto Yesu viyamhatile nie niwe wake. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ndugu zangu, sikiigelegeza mwenyego kamba nisha kugapata gaja gose ganilonda, ila kinhu kinitenda icho kino, kuisemwa gabitile na kuiyoha kutenda ganogile kukivikila kija kili haulongozi. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Noiyoha ng'hani kukimbilila kuja kunilondigwa kuvika, giladi mhate nhunza ilawa uchana kuulanga, nhunza ayo Mulungu kubitila Yesu Kilisto iyotukemela.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Avo tweye tose tukangale muloho tuwe na ngelegeza zilingane, na kamba ngelegeza zenu ziigola mkinhu chochose, kinhu kino vivija Mulungu kowagubulileni. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Vovose vondaiwe, natugendelele kuulongozi mnzila iija ituikweleleze mbaka kipigiti kino.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Ndugu zangu, ng'holelezeni nie, ifunzeni kulawa mwa awo wowinza mbuli zetu zitutendile sama yenu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Kwavija kamba vija vinikalile niwalongela umwaka, na sambi nowalongela kabili na mahozi, wanhu bwando wokala kamba wadumuka wa ifa ya Kilisto mumsalaba. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Kimambukizo chao kuzimu, wotambikila kija kisulukilwa na ng'huli zao, wokiigodela vinhu vigela kinyala, ngelegeza zao za m'vinhu va muisi. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Ila tweye uwenekae wetu wa kuulanga. Na tobeta mkusulukila ng'hani Mkombola wetu kulawa kuulanga, hiyo Mndewa Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Kozigalula ng'huli zetu zino zibanangika na kuzitenda zilinge kamba lukuli lwake mwenyego luli na yenzi, na kubitila mhiko iija vivija kodaha kuvitenda vinhu vose vikale hasi yake mwenyego.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Malagizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, iniwanogele na iniwasulukila ng'hani kuwona, nanahileni ha Mndewa, kwavija mweye iyo ndeng'ha yangu na mkungo unibokele sama ya sang'hano yangu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Yuodia na Sintike nowayalalila, mweye kamba ndugu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto mambukizeni m'vutem'vute wenu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Nokulongela gweye, uli munhu wangu wa habehi, wataze watwanzi wano, kwavija wasang'hanika ng'hani hamoja na nie kuweneza Usenga Unogile, hamoja na Kilementi na wasang'hana wayangu wayagwe, awo matwaga gao gandikigwe mkitabu cha ugima cha Mulungu. <verse eid="PHP 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Deng'heni mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa mazua gose. Nowalongela kabili, deng'heni.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Uhozi wenu utangike na wanhu wose, kwavija Mndewa ka mmabehi kwiza. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Sambimdungwedungwe na kinhu chochose, ila mnhambiko zenu zose mpuleni Mulungu gaja gomulonda na mazua gose mpuleni na mioyo ya hewela. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Na tindiwalo da Mulungu, dibanza ilimu zose za wanhu, doigwaa upile mioyo yenu na nzonzi zenu mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Ndugu zangu, nomambukiza mkulonga vino, nzonzi zenu zimeme mbuli zinogile, na zija zilumbile kugweleligwa nhogolwa, mbuli zimemile kweli, mbuli za kuhishimilwa, zilibule uzenzeleganye, zing'alile, zinogelwa na wanhu, na zili na nhogolwa inogile. Vigelegezeni vinhu vinogile na vilumbile kuhishimilwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Gendeleleni kuzitenda mbuli zose zimuifunzile, na zim'bokele, na zimuhulike, na zimziwene kulawa kumwangu. Na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu diwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kowaheweza Wafilipi Sama ya Nhunza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Nodeng'ha ng'hani mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa, kweli mkala munigelegeza nie, ila hamupatile nafasi ya kulagusa kamba mkala munigelegeza, hakimambukizo lelo mulagusa kabili vija vumunigelegeza nie. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Nolonga vino si kwavija nabule kinhu, kwavija nie niifundiza kwenelwa na kija kinili nacho. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Nivitanga kuhungukilwa na vinhu na nivitanga kuwa na vinhu bwando. Niifundiza kuwa mzihali zose, hali ya kwiguta na hali ya kuwa na nzala, hali ya kuwa na vinhu bwando na hali ya kuwa bule kinhu. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Nodaha kuzitenda mbuli zose kubitila Kilisto yongela mhiko. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Ila vinoga ng'hani kumwenu kunhaza nie mmigayo yangu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Mweye Wafilipi m'vitanga kamba mazua ga mwanduso ga Usenga Unogile, vunisegele muisi ya Makedonia, haduhu wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wowose wakalile hamoja na nie mkunigwelela vinhu sama ya sang'hano yangu ila mweye mwiyeka. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Kwavija hata vinikalile mdiwambo da Tesalonike viniwalondile mnhaze, mnhaza vinhu vinilondile si mwanza umwe. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Si kamba nie nozahila nhunza kulawa kumwenu, ila nolonda mweye m'bokele nhunza sama ya mbuli zinogile zimtendile. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi nipata vinhu vose vinilondile na kubanziliza, sambi nna kila kinhu vija vinibokele kulawa ha Epaflodito vummulagize yangalile. Nhunza zilinga kamba nhosa za vinhu va kunung'hila, nhosa imnogela Mulungu na kuitogola. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Na Mulungu wangu kowagwaa vinhu vose vumulonda kulawa muugoli wa yenzi yake, uyatugwelele tweye kubitila Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Yenzi na ichole ha Mulungu na Tata wetu milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Walamseni wanhu wose wa Mulungu wali hamoja na Yesu Kilisto. Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali hamoja na nie wowalamsa. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Wanhu wose wang'alile wowalamsa, ng'haning'hani waja wali mding'anda da Kaisali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaisali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa wa Loma.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Ngekewa ya Mndewa Yesu Kilisto iwe na loho zenu. Amina.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
